{"unit_id":"Mutsum1-WY__dsh-work-chain#card-zh","repo":"Mutsum1-WY/dsh-work-chain","commit":"093163e654deb180550ad6f8ceda159785776dd9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-work-chain 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的多智能体工作流插件。它把当前会话作为负责人，调用内置 Agent Teams 创建或复用配置好的队友，并通过团队任务板分派任务、收集摘要和结果文件。用户可以用 work_chain 将任务并行拆分，也可以用 work_flow 持续安排有依赖的多轮任务；成员可分别选择模型。启用审美顾问后，还能点名让它评审界面并返回建议。适合需要多模型并行执行、迭代验收或视觉意见的 DSH 用户；需要启用 Agent Teams 并配置可路由的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1331-1380","index.js:1809-1875","index.js:2208-2265"]}
{"unit_id":"Mutsum1-WY__dsh-work-chain#card-en","repo":"Mutsum1-WY/dsh-work-chain","commit":"093163e654deb180550ad6f8ceda159785776dd9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-work-chain coordinates parallel tasks through DSH Agent Teams. The current session leads; configured teammates use selected models and return results. work_chain splits tasks; work_flow handles dependent tasks. An optional advisor reviews interfaces. Requires Team services and routable models.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1331-1380","index.js:1809-1875","index.js:2208-2265"]}
